full-corner-standard-semifiniteness-repair-closeout.md\naristotle_responses/P55D-regional-concrete-cstar-alpha-b0d05732-e08192b8-quarantine/aristotle-stabilizer_two_lane_p55d-qxitlbh1_aristotle/work/FORMALIZATION-AUDIT-DECISION.md\naristotle_responses/P55D-regional-concrete-cstar-alpha-b0d05732-e08192b8-quarantine/aristotle-stabilizer_two_lane_p55d-qxitlbh1_aristotle/work/FORMALIZATION-SEMANTIC-AUDIT.md\naristotle_responses/P55D-regional-concrete-cstar-alpha-b0d05732-e08192b8-quarantine/aristotle-stabilizer_two_lane_p55d-qxitlbh1_aristotle/work/TWO-LANE-FORMALIZATION-DECISION.md\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
